Interpretation: 'tail_harm_ms' = extra TTFT to recompute the 528-token
partial-block tail on each re-issue (what the big page costs vs a 0-tail).
If it grows with scale, the big-page recompute harm worsens with context.
NB (08_hybrid_architectural_blocker): on hybrid this tail is NOT
removable by finer attention caching — mamba forces recompute. So this
is a real big-page downside the interlayer sub-block fix does NOT capture.
